      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나는 포켓몬의 기초 포인트를\n순백의 상태로 만들어서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n새출발을 할 수 있게 돕고 있어.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B2940020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020AE30CD080020D3ECC778D2B8B97C000AC21CBC31C7580020C0C1D0DCB85C0020B9CCB4E4C5B4C11C00100001BE00000AC0C8CD9CBC1CC7440020D5600020C2180020C788AC8C0020B3D5ACE00020C788C5B4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "순백의 상태가 되는 데는\n메가조각 <U+0010><U+0003>Ȅ<U+0002><U+0000>개가 필요하니까<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n필요하면 내게 말을 걸어 줘.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C21CBC31C7580020C0C1D0DCAC000020B418B2940020B370B294000ABA54AC00C870AC01002000100003020400020000AC1CAC000020D544C694D558B2C8AE4C00100001BE00000AD544C694D558BA740020B0B4AC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C918002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나는 순백아가씨.",
